# Adding a card field

1. **SRS** — Map to `docs/SSOT/SRS.md` (FR-CARDS).
2. **Types** — `src/domain/types.ts`: `CandidateCard` / `JobCard`, `empty*Card()`, normalizers.
3. **AI patch** — `src/infrastructure/ai/schemas.ts`: `candidatePatchSchema` / `jobPatchSchema`.
4. **Merge** — `src/application/chat-turn.ts` (`applyCandidatePatchSafely` / `applyJobPatch`); CV path in `domain/cv-merge.ts` if needed.
5. **UI / API projections** — `domain/candidate-card-views.ts`, employer presentation rules (FR-CARD-VIEW-03).
6. **Embeddings** — If the field is match-critical text, add it to the right segment in `src/domain/card-embedding-text.ts` (role / skills / profile). Location/salary usually stay rule-only.
7. **Tests** — Domain or application test for merge behavior; run `npm test`.

Do not add fields only to UI without schema + patch support.
